#  NX AI Assistant custom directories file
#
#  Point the user environment variable UGII_CUSTOM_DIRECTORY_FILE at this
#  file so NX loads the NX AI Assistant custom directory at startup.
#  This file deliberately keeps the legacy NX_MCP custom directory listed
#  so existing deployments keep working; the legacy project itself is not
#  modified. Directories must be listed one per line with nothing else
#  on the line (NX custom_dirs.dat format).
D:\AI\NX_MCP\nx_custom
D:\AI\NX_AI_ASSISTANT\deploy\nxai_custom
